{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 發佈 watchOS 27.2.1 及 visionOS 27.2.1 更新，兩個更新在 watchOS 27.2 及 visionOS 27.2 推出兩星期後發佈。watchOS 版本涉及安全修復，visionOS 版本另包括錯誤修正。</p>\n<h2>兩系統修復範圍不同</h2>\n<p>根據 Apple 的更新說明，watchOS 27.2.1 包含安全修復；visionOS 27.2.1 則包含安全更新及錯誤修正。兩個更新可透過各裝置的「設定」應用程式安裝。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 visionOS 27 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/visionos-1.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.354088+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T18:32:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:55:17.976586+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:05.872779+00:00","content_hash":"1898035117400f0699c5cf13a14a3ed05e5250edbcad790bd340b5d7a36524ed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}